OL,3,GNEWSAFootballer turns to fundraiser for
OL,4,Aknee operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA non-league footballer is fundraising
OL,7,Ffor his own operation after rupturing
OL,8,Fhis anterior cruciate ligament (ACL).
OL,10,FAnge Djadja suffered the season-ending
OL,11,Finjury while playing for Braintree
OL,12,FTown's under-21 side in August.
OL,14,FThe 23-year-old defender estimated the
OL,15,Fcost of surgery and rehabilitation
OL,16,Fcould top #10,000.
OL,18,FHe said: "The quicker I get it done,
OL,19,Fthe quicker I can return to doing what
OL,20,FI do best - and that's playing
OL,21,Ffootball."
